# Credentials. The package's live suites read AUTH_TOKEN from the environment and the token
# lives outside any repository (~/.yandex-auth-token, mode 600). These patterns exist so a
# copy made "just for a minute" cannot be committed by accident.
*.token
*auth-token*
*-token
.env
.env.*
secrets.*
*.pem
*.p12

# NOT ignored, deliberately, and both differ from the sibling package:
#   *.xcodeproj      — this repo *is* the app, so the project file is the product.
#   Package.resolved — an app pins its dependencies; a library lets consumers resolve their
#                      own. See the workspace CLAUDE.md.
.thumbnail
